<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-month T-bill yield drops to 21.67 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-month T-bill yield drops to 21.67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.67 percent on Wednesday, up from 21.46 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	   5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     4,430.07 million forints</p>
<p>   Total allocated	   4,430.07 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	     4,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.67 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.8743 pct</p>
</text>
